              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le feu d'artifice — \"the fireworks (display)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le feu d'artifice a commencé à vingt-trois heures. The fireworks started at eleven at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: les feux d'artifice."
            }
          ]
        },
